"CHAMPS/SAM/abil/2/desc": "Heals the most wounded nearby ally and speeds them up.",
"CHAMPS/SAM/abil/3/name": "Realm of Essence",
"CHAMPS/SAM/abil/3/desc": "Tears space open in a straight line after channelling.",
