"CHAMPS/FULGENCE/title": "The Rock of Marcory",
"CHAMPS/FULGENCE/passive/name": "Rock",
"CHAMPS/FULGENCE/passive/desc": "Below 40% HP, gains a shield worth 15% of max HP (40 s cooldown).",
"CHAMPS/FULGENCE/abil/0/name": "Body in the Way",
"CHAMPS/FULGENCE/abil/0/desc": "A short charge that knocks back the enemies it hits.",
